202608/prompts/artifacts_beads_and_files_subtabs.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-dd[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-dd/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Sub-tab taxonomy, nested Files container, and keymap surface[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]shell[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]shell: retype the Artifacts sub-tabs to commits/beads/bugs/prs/files, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mount a nested tab strip inside Files that hosts Plans, Chats, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Other, re-key every mark/jump/detail/copy/footer store off a pane key [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of a sub-tab, and declare all new keymap fields, bindings, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]action stubs up front.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Read-only Beads pane[/bold #D7AFFF]                                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]beads_view[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shell[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]beads_view: load beads off-thread behind an mtime-keyed snapshot, render[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a Tasks section and an expandable Epics tree in which every bead appears[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exactly once, build the detail panel from shared bead presentation [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]metadata, and wire navigation, marks, and jump hints.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bead filter query and inline filter bar[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]beads_filters[dim] · [dim][/dim]after beads_view[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]beads_filters: parse a bead filter query covering type, status, tier, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]size, project, people, has, and date terms, prefold it into a reusable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record index, and drive an inline completion bar whose hide-closed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]default stays visible in the info line.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bead mutations, close-with-reason, and triage-gate settlement[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]beads_actions[dim] · [dim][/dim]after beads_view[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]beads_actions: run every bead write as a tracked background task through[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the shared store-mutation facade, add create, edit, note, status, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]launch, and close surfaces, and settle the matching pending triage gate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]when a task bead is closed or launched from the pane.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plans sub-sub-tab dedicated to plan documents[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plans_focus[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shell[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plans_focus: regroup the pane into pending proposals, plans linked from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]live beads, and the archive, delete the bead rows and bead-only actions,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and retune the filter vocabulary, detail panel, and copy targets to plan[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documents.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bidirectional bead and plan jumps with conditional footer [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]hints[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]crosslinks[dim] · [dim][/dim]after beads_filters, beads_actions, plans_focus[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]crosslinks: resolve each row's counterpart across the two panes, switch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sub-tabs and apply a pending selection that survives an unloaded target [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pane, and surface the jump key